\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  mixed, stocks higher on lower oil, tepid dollar\b0\par\par\uc2 By Karin Strohecker   \par \uc2 549 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2015\par 11:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, March 18 (Reuters) - Emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded mixed on Wednesday while stocks rose to an 8-day high, lifted by lower oil prices and a tepid dollar ahead of a hotly anticipated \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting ending later in the day.\par \par \uc2 In China, the yuan posted its strongest daily gain in a year to hit a 2-month high against the dollar, which traders said was likely to reflect \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rouble rose 0.5 percent as exporters sold hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to settle tax bills, shrugging off oil falling towards $53 a barrel.\par \par \uc2 However, South Africa's rand, Turkey's lira and the Brazilian real all eased against the greenback ahead of the Fed's policy statement, widely anticipated to lay the ground for the first U.S. interest rate hike in nearly a decade later in the year.\par \par \uc2 "The immediate focus is on the Federal Open Market Committee tonight," said \uc2 UBS\uc2  strategist Manik Narain.\par \par \uc2 "I don't think we will get too much relief on emerging markets and the risk is the market realises the Fed is determined to move at a faster trajectory than the market is pricing in," he added.\par \par \uc2 Emerging market stocks rose 0.6 percent to an 8-day high, gaining ground for the third straight session, lifted by China's benchmark indexes jumping more than 2 percent to a near 7-year high on hopes that Beijing will unveil fresh economic stimulus.\par \par \uc2 In Moscow, both dollar and rouble-denominated shares gained ground while in Israel shares rose 0.6 percent after Prime Minister \uc2 Benjamin Netanyahu\uc2  won a surprise election victory, though the shekel traded flat.\par \par \uc2 Across the Middle East, stocks were trading well in the red with Dubai down as much as 4.5 percent, dragged down by sliding oil prices.\par \par \uc2 In eastern Europe, \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded flat to lower against the euro as Bulgaria and Slovenia gear up to issue euro denominated bonds.\par \par \uc2 "For finance ministries this is possibly a case of 'goldilocks' timing; right after the start of ECB QE and before potential pressure from rising U.S. yields and a rebound in inflation," \uc2 Unicredit\uc2  analysts told clients of the heavy demand for recent euro debt issues from Croatia and Bulgaria.\par \par \uc2 Romania is also expected to tap markets in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 In Ukraine, dollar bond prices recovered across the curve by as much as 1.255 cents following a drubbing on Tuesday when talks about restructuring Kiev's debt ran into difficulties straight from the beginning.\par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Natalia Yaresko pledged late on Tuesday in Washington that the country wants to be flexible over renegotiating its debt and would not rule out any form of agreement.\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance 2015, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/jus35t"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/jus35t}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance 2015, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/weh36s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/weh36s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging Europe performance 2015, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/jun28s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/jun28s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI frontier index performance 2015, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s}}}\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see ) (Additional reporting by Sujata Rao; Editing by Crispian Balmer) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-3-18T11:34:00.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150318eb3i00cqx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
