mments by the head of \uc2 OPEC\uc2  against weak fundamentals showing little evidence of improving.\par \par \uc2 Obama to Propose Opening More Areas to Drilling\par \par \uc2 The Obama administration is planning to propose opening up new areas of the nation's federally owned waters to oil and natural gas drilling, including areas along the Atlantic Coast, according to people familiar with the plan.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 January 27, 2015 07:47 ET (12:47 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150127eb1r001i6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
