\par\par \b \uc2 GRAPHIC-Ukraine, Russia, Nigeria reserve losses buck steady 2014 EM trend\b0\par\par\uc2 By Sujata Rao   \par \uc2 497 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 2015\par 13:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Jan 12 (Reuters) - Crisis-ridden Russia and Ukraine suffered drastic falls in hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves last year, with Kiev showing a record 63 percent drop, but reserves in most other emerging markets were largely steady.\par \par \uc2 Data showed on Monday that Ukrainian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves had fallen to 7.5 billion by end-2014 from over $20 billion a year before - more than any other country in percentage terms, the following graphic shows:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/huf76v"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/huf76v}}}\par \par \uc2 Ukraine is also worse off than any other emerging market in terms of reserve adequacy, this graphic, based on \uc2 Bank of America/Merrill Lynch\uc2  data, shows:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/san42w"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/san42w}}}\par \par \uc2 "Ukraine is now beyond life support," said Standard Bank analyst Tim Ash. "Reserves have dropped $12.9 billion over the year - probably a clear indication of the size of the annual financing gap."\par \par \uc2 Ukraine's reserves can now pay for just over one month of imports versus the three months deemed to be the safe minimum. The second yardstick requires reserves to be at least equal to external debt payments due in the coming year. Ukraine falls short on this measure too.\par \par \uc2 Reserves have shrunk because of debt repayments and \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the hryvnia. The data shows Ukraine in grave danger of financial collapse and debt default.\par \par \uc2 Neighbouring Russia, on the other hand, has enough cash to fund 10 months of imports, while reserves cover short-term debt four times. That is despite a staggering $120 billion - or 24 percent - fall that took reserves to $388 billion due to rouble-defensive \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent $76.1 billion and 5.4 billion euros in the rouble's defence, Interfax said, citing \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data. Valuation effects also hurt as the euro - 40 percent of Russian reserves, fell 12 percent over the year.\par \par \uc2 Other countries that saw large reserve declines include South Africa and Nigeria with 14 and 21 percent falls respectively.\par \par \uc2 But in many others, reserves went up, rising 6, 9 and 12 percent respectively in South Korea, India and Indonesia. Mexico saw a 11 percent rise while Brazil was steady. An \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  loan almost doubled Pakistani reserves.\par \par \uc2 Overall emerging market reserves, not including China, rose by $50 billion in 2014 to $4.13 trillion, according to the following graphic based on data from consultancy \uc2 CrossBorder Capital\uc2 :{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/nyf76v"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/nyf76v}}}\par \par \uc2 "EM reserves have broadly remained flattish and what that meant is that while capital inflows diminished, many countries also saw a rebound in foreign earnings as \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  devalued," said \uc2 Michael Howell\uc2 , managing director of CrossBorder Capital.\par \par \uc2 "They have allowed \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to devalue significantly rather than allow reserves to decline."\par \par \uc2 The rand and lira fell 8-10 percent in 2014 while most Asian and Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  also posted losses against the dollar. (Graphic by Vincent Flasseur; Editing by Mark Heinrich) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-1-13T13:34:52.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150113eb1d00cq6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
