\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Markets Edge Higher After  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  Ruble Shock -- Barron's Blog\b0\par\par\uc2 By Dimitra DeFotis  \par \uc2 678 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 2014\par 18:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's surprise \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is roiling markets today, but the ruble is recovering a bit and emerging markets moved higher.\par \par \uc2 In recent trading, the weak ruble was trading below 70 to the U.S. dollar; early in the day, the ruble reached 80 to the dollar, a record low and a 35% decline from opening level, The Wall Street Journal reports.\par \par \uc2 In recent trading, the \uc2 iShares MSCI Emerging Markets ETF\uc2  ( EEM) is up 0.5%, while the Market Vectors Russia ETF ( RSX) was down 3% in recent trading. Mining companies are moving higher today, including U.S.-traded shares Russia's \uc2 Norilsk Nickel\uc2  ( NILSY), which are up 4%. But U.S. shares of \uc2 Sberbank\uc2  Rossia ( SBRCY) are down 13%.\par \par \uc2 Russia needs to shake out speculators from the ruble trade says Benoit Anne at \uc2 Societe Generale\uc2 , who writes:\par \par \uc2 "It is about time the Russian authorities escalated the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis management to the Kremlin. And if I were them, I would also have Washington on my speed dial (the \uc2 IMF\uc2  I mean, of course) ...\par \par \uc2 The initial RUB bounce was probably not large enough to trigger some major long USD stop losses. In other words, some of the short RUB speculative positions are still in place. Second, the stress surrounding the RUB market appears to have mutated in a major way and is now essentially a domestic retail flow problem. Essentially, the local population--or at least part of it--after having witnessed the recent RUB slide, is not that comfortable holding loads of ruble anymore, and has decided to make the switch to dollars, a phenomenon we observe in global emerging markets (GEM) on a regular basis when the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes under severe pressure. The main challenge for the authorities now is to restore confidence towards the RUB within the population, which is not necessarily easily done through another rate hike. This means that the authorities need to explore other tools. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -- Step 1, if I were the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Russia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (CBR), I would now \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par       heavily in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to take the speculative shorts out of the \par       picture. That may need to push the RUB back to below 55 though, which \par       means that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  needs to come with at least $5 billion in one \par       go, if not more. \par  \par  \par    -- Step 2, once the locals see the RUB turn around a bit, the overall \par       sentiment picture should improve, but ...  authorities should send a \par       clear message that they stand ready to be in bail-out mode, if need be, \par       which ultimately should help. Also, the authorities should do whatever is \par       needed to stop the population's concerns about their cash. A strong \par       political signal, beyond the simple mandate of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , may be \par       necessary ..." \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Direxion Daily Russia Bull 3X Shares ETF ( RUSL) is down nealry 8%, while the Direxion Daily Russia Bear 3X Shares ETF ( RUSS) is up 7.8%. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  More at Barron's Emerging Markets blog,  \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://blogs.barrons.com/emergingmarketsdaily/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://blogs.barrons.com/emergingmarketsdaily/ }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Soci\u233\'00\'E9t\u233\'00\'E9 G\u233\'00\'E9n\u233\'00\'E9rale SA\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=FR0000130809"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=FR0000130809 }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for MMC \f28 \uc2 \f2 Norilsk Nickel\f28 \uc2 \f2  JSC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0007288411"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0007288411 }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sberbank Russia OJSC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029540"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029540 }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sberbank Russia OJSC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029557"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029557 }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 iShares MSCI Emerging Markets ETF\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US4642872349"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US4642872349 }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for MMC \f28 \uc2 \f2 Norilsk Nickel\f28 \uc2 \f2  JSC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P47