\par\par \b \uc2 Ruble, Russia's \uc2 Sberbank\uc2  Tumble To New Lows -- Barron's Blog\b0\par\par\uc2 By Teresa Rivas   \par \uc2 405 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 2014\par 16:03\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 While oil is tiptoeing off its lows Monday, there's no relief in sight for Russia: Its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped to a new low against the dollar, down more than 4%.\par \par \uc2 Today's weakness follows on the heels of several days of losses last week, even as \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hiked interest rates. The decline of the ruble isn't surprising, given oil's recent slide and ongoing sanctions aimed at curbing Moscow's conflict with Ukraine. Indeed, on Friday, Capital Economics predicted that the trifecta of sanctions, low oil prices, and a soft ruble would cause Russia's economy to contract 1% next year.\par \par \uc2 Certainly, there doesn't seem to be any relief in sight, a The Wall Street Journal's Andrey Ostroukh and Chiara Albanese report:\par \par \uc2 The ruble was changing hands at 61.25 against the U.S. dollar in late trading in Moscow, down more than 4% on the day, despite a rebound in Brent crude prices above $63 a barrel from an earlier low of $60.55.\par \par \uc2 The ruble's rebound after touching an early low mirrors a recent pattern that traders suspect reflects \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  laid low by falling oil prices, which are a major blow for Russia's energy-export dependent economy.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have sold some $700 million in the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to a person close to the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on its market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and reveals market activity with a two-day lag.\par \par \uc2 At recent check, the Market Vectors Russia ETF ( RSX)and the Direxion Daily Russia Bull 3X Shares ETF ( RUSL) were both deep in the red, while the Direxion Daily Russia Bear 3X Shares ETF ( RUSS) was rising. \uc2 Sberbank\uc2  ( SBRCY), off more than 6%, touched a fresh low today as well. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  More at Barron's Emerging Markets blog, \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://blogs.barrons.com/emergingmarketsdaily/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://blogs.barrons.com/emergingmarketsdaily/}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sberbank Russia OJSC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029540"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029540}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sberbank Russia OJSC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029557"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=RU0009029557}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sberbank Russia OJSC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US80585Y3080"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US80585Y3080}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 15, 2014 10:03 ET (15:03 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141215eacf0026y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal25