\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Rouble bounces on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk, other oil  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  fall\b0\par\par\uc2 By Chris Vellacott   \par \uc2 456 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Dezember 2014\par 10:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Dec 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rouble bounced almost 2 percent against the dollar on Friday, driven by suspicions that the \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stepped up its defence of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which has sunk 5 percent this week.\par \par \uc2 President \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 , in his state of the nation address on Thursday, instructed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Finance Ministry to act together in fighting off speculators.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is down almost 40 percent this year, hit by an oil price slump and Western sanctions.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which releases its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data with a two-day lag, said on Friday it had conducted $1.9 billion worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Dec. 2.\par \par \uc2 "The fall in oil prices would point to the rouble at 50 to the dollar so, it's not far off. It has overshot a bit, but that's what happens when you have a big selloff. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have introduced two-way risk into the market and I think there is a good chance we could see another significant rate hike of 100 basis points," said Neil Shearing, head of emerging market research at Capital Economics.\par \par \uc2 As Brent crude traded below $70, other oil \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  also fell. Nigeria's naira lost 0.5 percent against the dollar and Malaysia's ringgit 0.7 percent to hit a five-year low.\par \par \uc2 Emerging market stocks trod water with the MSCI Emerging equities index flat as investors waited for U.S. jobs data later on Friday.\par \par \uc2 In China, however, Shanghai stocks gained 1.36 percent, marking its strongest weekly gain for five years, with investors betting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is about to implement aggressive monetary easing to shore up growth.\par \par \uc2 "China's outlook for growth hasn't changed materially, but we have had a bit of easing. It's a classic frenzy among retail investors driving the market higher and the market is looking a bit frothy," Shearing said.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Ethiopia launched a $1 billion debut Eurobond with a term of 10 years and a yield of 6.625 percent on Thursday, attracting an initial order book worth more than $2.6 billion.\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/jus35t"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/jus35t}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/weh36s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/weh36s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging Europe performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/jun28s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/jun28s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI frontier index performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s}}}\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see ) (Additional reporting by Sujata Rao; Editing by Kevin Liffey) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-12-5T