\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Considers  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Options, Says Citi -- Market Talk\b0\par\par\uc2 1,395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 2014\par 10:29\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 0929 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ]--While direct support of the ruble was seen as unlikely until recently, the move of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  above 54 against the dollar is pushing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to act. "The rapid fall in oil and the ruble in recent weeks has made support options such as \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and capital controls more probable," says \uc2 Citigroup\uc2 . "Ruble defense strategy will be selected so we do not alter our sector strategy at this time," they say. While no further \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are likely to see the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fall further, looking at local companies capital controls would create significant risks for exporters as \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  receipts could be subject to obligatory conversion to rubles or dividends could be restricted. Other options would be a rate hike, \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and foreign policy. USD/RUB is now at 54.66. (chiara.albanese@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 0929 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ] The USD/PHP is lower late Wednesday, still weighed down by steady inflow of funds for investments in government securities. Overseas workers' remittance, usually strongest in December because of the Christmas season spending, is also dragging down the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pair, a Manila-based trader says. The USD/PHP is at 44.68--a two-month low--after settling late Tuesday to 44.735. Volume is moderately heavy. Traders expect the USD/PHP to stay within the 44.50-45.00 range in the near-term. (cris.larano@dowjones.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0923 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The weak run of November European services PMIs has given sterling a bid tone on the euro cross ahead of the release of the U.K. version of this number. EUR/GBP falls to a near one-month low of 0.7882, while against the dollar it trades at $1.5650. The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2  survey forecast for the U.K. November services PMI is 56.1 vs 56.2 last. Data due 0930 GMT. (gary.stride@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0923 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] A Philippine senator has filed a bill seeking to curb the use of dummy incorporators with the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Securities and Exchange Commission\f28 \uc2 \f2  (SEC) to improve transparency in business dealings in the country. One of these provisions, according to Senator Paolo Benigno Aquino, is the introduction of a one-person corporation, which is expected to eliminate the need for dummy incorporators. Currently, a sole proprietor needs incorporators of five to 15 individuals to be able to register with the SEC. These individuals are "dummies" in the sense they may be employees or people outside the firm--really, anyone conveniently available to sign relevant documents. Senator Aquino said in a statement that the introduction of the one-person corporation will increase the ease of doing business in the country as well as encourage more entrepreneurs to expand their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and become a corporation, which would generate more jobs. (Josephine.cuneta@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0912 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--EUR/SEK spiked to fresh 1-month highs above 9.30 Tuesday, triggered by political uncertainty surrounding the new budget, and whether Sweden risks a new round of elections early next year, says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Saxo Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Head of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Strategy John J Hardy. Says the longer the uncertainty is drawn out, the higher the risks for SEK, especially if EUR/SEK sustains a break above 9.30 in the sessions ahead. The cross is now at 9.28. gary.stride@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0908 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Private sector activity in the eurozone slowed more sharply than first estimated in November, with the composite PMI revised down to 51.1 from 51.4, versus 52.3 in October. The details also make for grim reading, with new orders falling, and businesses cutting their prices. France edged further into contraction, while Spain's services sector slowed sharply, and while Italy picked up, that doesn't seem likely to herald the start of a sustained recovery. Overall, a set of surveys that increase pressure on the ECB to up its stimulus measures. (paul.hannon@wsj.com, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Twitter\f28 \uc2 \f2 : @PaulHannon29) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0906 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Swiss 3Q gross domestic product growth was boosted by a pick-up in exports and domestic consumption, according to the BAKBasel research institute, but the lack of increased capital investment, necessary for a broad economic recovery, is missing. "Data suggest exports have made a solid start in the fourth quarter, but the uncertainties remain high, while the building sector boom is expected to cool next year," says BAKBasel economist Martin Eichler. (neil.maclucas@dowjones.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0904 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Intra-eurozone government bond yields are expected to tighten with or without QE by the ECB, \f28 \uc2 \f2 JPMorgan\f28 \uc2 \f2  says. Sees the probability of sovereign QE at around 30% and rising above 50% only if low growth continues in the single \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  area. \f28 \uc2 \f2 J.P. Morgan\f28 \uc2 \f2  favors the Netherlands within core markets and Ireland in the periphery, based on its sovereign risk index. (emese.bartha@wsj.com; @EmeseBartha) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0851 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Activity in Italy's services sector picked up in November for the second straight month, with the PMI rising to 51.8 from 50.8 in October. However, it doesn't seem likely that the recovery has much further to go over coming months, with new orders falling during the month. In response, services providers cut jobs, and they also cut prices at the second-fastest pace in the past 16 months. So while the headline number looks encouraging, the details are not. (paul.hannon@wsj.com, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Twitter\f28 \uc2 \f2 : @PaulHannon29) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0850 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] The Philippines has become less corrupt over the past three years, according to the latest survey of anti-corruption group \f28 \uc2 \f2 Transparency International\f28 \uc2 \f2 . This will help the country attract more foreign direct investment. The Philippines ranked 85th out of 175 countries in TI's Corruption Perceptions Index for 2014, an improvement from 94th in 2013, and 105th in 2012. Although the Philippines still scored below 50 in the index, its CPI score of 38 for 2014 is a "marked improvement" from how it fared in 2012 at 34, and 36 in 2013, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Transparency International\f28 \uc2 \f2  said. Two-thirds of countries included in the survey scored below 50. The improvement in the Philippines' ranking comes amid a sustained reform drive by Aquino administration, which includes more transparency in the budget process and efforts to clean up government agencies perceived to be corrupt. The improvement in the Philippines' ranking in \f28 \uc2 \f2 Transparency International\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Corruption Perception Index was consistent with the latest report by \f28 \uc2 \f2 the World Bank Group\f28 \uc2 \f2  on Worldwide Governance Indicators (WGI), which also saw improvement. (Josephine.cuneta@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0843 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The November Spanish services PMI sharply disappointed at 52.7 from 55.9 in October. Up next is Italy (0845 GMT), the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2  survey forecast is 50.3 vs 50.8 last. This is followed by France (0850 GMT), 48.8 vs 48.3, Germany (0855 GMT) 52.1 vs 54.4, and the eurozone (0900 GMT) 51.3 vs 52.3. Euro now trades at a fresh 2-year low of $1.2339. (gary.stride@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0839 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The zloty is trading strong ahead of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Polish \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's interest rate decision due later Wednesday. The market expects the benchmark interest rate to remain unchanged at 2% and should the rate panel send a clear signal further monetary easing is unlikely, the zloty could strengthen further, BZ WBK bank writes in a note. EUR/PLN trades at 4.1593. (patryk.wasilewski@dowjones.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 03, 2014 04:29 ET (09:29 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141203eac3000w1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
