\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES \highlight\uc2 : Falling Oil Drags Ruble To Another Record Low Against Dollar\b0\par\par\uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 2014\par 16:13\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 By Joseph Adinolfi, MarketWatch Dollar tops 119 yen, then gives back gains\par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (MarketWatch) -- The ruble plunged Monday to a fresh record low against the dollar as crude-oil futures tumbled, creating speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The ruble (USDRUB) hit a low of 1.86 cents, before recovering to around the 2-cent level, around where it traded Friday afternoon.\par \par \uc2 U.S. West Texas Intermediate crude futures hit a low of $63.72 Monday, before recovering slightly to $66.59 in recent trade.\par \par \uc2 The ruble has proved to be the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that is most sensitive to movements in the price of oil, far more so than the Canadian dollar (USDCAD) and the Norwegian krone (USDNOK), which both rose against the U.S. dollar Monday.\par \par \uc2 "Due to the aggressive recoupling of oil and the RUB in the last few days, we could see this relationship persist for some time. Thus, as long as the oil price falls, the RUB could come under pressure," said \uc2 Kathleen Brooks\uc2 , a research director at \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 .com, in a Monday morning research note.\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 10, the \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  abandoned a policy that held ruble to within a set band, allowing it instead to trade freely after the ruble hit a series of record lows against the greenback. However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to fight off "financial stability threats."\par \par \uc2 "This is why we would urge caution in the short term, as the sharp decline in the RUB could be characterized as a financial stability threat, which may trigger larger \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and unexpected, volatile moves in the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Brooks said.\par \par \uc2 Dollar climbs, then falls against yen\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere, the dollar slipped against the yen(USDJPY) after initially climbing on news that Moody's Investors Service downgraded Japan's sovereign debt one notch, from A1 to Aa3, citing "heightened uncertainty over the achievability of fiscal deficit reduction" after the government delayed a sales-tax hike by 18 months.\par \par \uc2 The greenback traded as high as 119.1500 yen, its highest level since July 2007, before dropping to a session low of Yen118.0880. It recently around Yen118.28, compared to Yen118.61 Friday afternoon.\par \par \uc2 "Once people had a chance to think, they realized 90% of Japanese Government Bonds are in domestic hands, so it doesn't really matter what a U.S. ratings agency says [about Japanese sovereign debt]," said \uc2 Boris Schlossberg\uc2 , managing director of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at BK Asset Management.\par \par \uc2 The pound rose against the dollar after data showed U.K. manufacturing expanded at a faster-than-expected clip in November. The pound (GBPUSD) traded at $1.5739, compared to $1.5644 Friday. Elsewhere, the euro (EURGBP) traded flat against the pound at GBP0.7931, compared to GBP0.7957 Friday.\par \par \uc2 The ICE U.S. Dollar Index (DXY), a measure of the greenback's strength against a basket of six rival \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was 0.41% lower at 87.9800.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 December 01, 2014 10:13 ET (15:13 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141201eac10022d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw145\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2175\pichgoal600
