\par\par \b \uc2 RBI Unlikely To Change Stance On Inflation Data -- Market Talk\b0\par\par\uc2 1,454 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 November 2014\par 13:45\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 1245 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ]--India's October inflation as measured by consumer prices is broadly in line with market expectations and doesn't warrant a change in stance of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says Sudhir Agrawal, fund Manager for fixed income at \uc2 UTI Mutual Fund\uc2 . "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  too would have been expecting a similar number," he says. "It is important to see how inflation behaves once the base effect wanes in the next couple of months." India's retail inflation fell to 5.52% in October. Analysts had expected the data print to be around 5.70%. Government bonds may open higher on Thursday but could later see selling in the session as traders may unwind positions built ahead of the data release. The yield on the 10-year benchmark bond may stay in a 8.14%-8.18% range, Mr. Agrawal says. (nupur.acharya@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 1236 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ]--The Greek economy is expected to return to growth for the first since the second quarter of 2008. Seasonally-adjusted gross domestic product is expected to grow by 1.4% on-year and 1%-1.1% on-quarter, according Nikos Magginas, a senior economist at NBG. NBG projects that Greece is on track to meet its full year growth target of 0.6%, as forecast by the country's government and its international creditors. Greece's national statistics agency is expected to announce 3Q GDP figures Friday. (nektaria.stamouli@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1236 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Weakening ruble and declining consumers' purchasing power result in a year-on-year 8.4% drop in throughput at Russian ports in October. UralSib expects container traffic in Russia to continue its decline in the coming months, reflecting a weaker ruble and stagnating economy. (alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1230 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]-- Simon Hunt, financial services risk and regulation partner at PwC says that, while many banks have made significant progress in addressing the conduct and control-related issues in their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  businesses, more work needs to be done to ensure that sustainable changes to business practices, behaviors and controls are embedded. "The industry has invested heavily in more effective supervision over the past two years, particularly to respond to previous unauthorised trading incidents. However, ensuring the broader conduct agenda is effectively embedded into supervisory mechanisms remains a work in progress," he adds. (josie.cox@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 7:30 EST - Soft through the overnight, US stock-index futures have slid to session lows of late after a week straight of record closing highs--albeit barely in cases like yesterday. But after some news tidbits--largely meek thus far--retailers get to possibly impose their will on the market starting today with \f28 \uc2 \f2 Macy's\f28 \uc2 \f2  (M) F3Q report in a half-hour, kicking off the sector's earnings season. Between the companies reporting by week's end and Friday's government data on retail sales, it should be clearer where the consumer stands ahead of the holidays. S&P 500 futures are down 7 while gold is flat and oil slides anew. The euro is flat against the dollar at $1.2465 and Treasurys--after Tuesday's holiday--are higher, pushing the 10-year yield down to 2.34%. (kevin.kingsbury@wsj.com; @kevinkingsbury)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1220 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market expects the next step by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Russia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to be large "ad hoc \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ", after it has limited ruble liquidity it offers the banks, VTB says. Calls the decision to limit the maximum amount of ruble liquidity provided under the overnight \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swap facility the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's "first practical step to curb pressure on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market." (alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1212 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]-- Andrew Goldberg, global market strategist at \f28 \uc2 \f2 J.P. Morgan Asset Management\f28 \uc2 \f2 , says that the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of England\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Inflation Report was carefully worded and broadly balanced, not giving an "uber-bull" or an "uber-bear" much to latch on to or react dramatically to. "A lot of what the BOE said referred to concerns beyond the U.K. and it was quite encouraging on the U.K. itself," Mr. Goldberg says. Nonetheless, his colleague Alex Dryden, says that the report has triggered some to delay their interest rate hike forecasts and question whether the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of England\f28 \uc2 \f2  will indeed act before the U.S. Federal Reserve. (josie.cox@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1158 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] Despite a heavy selloff by foreign investors, Thailand's main stock market still managed to record further gains last month. The Stock Exchange of Thailand index rose 22% and its market cap increased 25.5% in October compared with the end of 2013. The Thai Exchange's daily average trading value was also up 20.33% on-year. However, trading on the Thai bourse was considerably hit last month when foreign investors ended up as the market's net sellers of $497 million--resulting in their combined net selling of $585 million for the first 10 months of 2014. "The market mood in October was weighed down by profit taking and concerns over global economic volatility," says the SET.(nopparat.chaichalearmmongkol@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KBC \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1150 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--USD/JPY came off its fresh 7-year highs above 116.00 after official denials PM Abe was considering a postponement of next October's sales tax hike and calling a snap-election. Now at 115.25, BBH pegs initial support near 115.00-114.80, but says it would take a break below 114.00 to be anything significant from a technical point of view. (gary.stride@dowjones.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1123 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--\f28 \uc2 \f2 Credit Suisse\f28 \uc2 \f2  economist Mirco Bulega says that below-forecast eurozone inflation figures for September pave the way for weak growth in the third quarter and mean there is a "high chance of a flat gross domestic product print this Friday". In its final data release before the third-quarter figures, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eurostat\f28 \uc2 \f2  said production by factories, mines and utilities during September was up 0.6% from August, and 0.6% higher than the same month in 2013. That was a slightly smaller rise than economists had expected. "An insipid GDP would add to pressures on the ECB to deliver further stimulus," Mr. Bulega says. (josie.cox@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 6:15 EST - The default rate among Brazilian consumers continued to rise last month as the country's poor economic activity, combined with high interest rates and inflationary pressures, hits cash flow. Defaults rose 14% versus October 2013, says consumer-credit rating bureau Serasa Experian, putting the year-to-date increase at 5.1%. Through September, the growth was 4.2%. (rogerio.jelmayer@wsj.com)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0000 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] The $1.60 level on Cable remains elusive, following the sharp setback from $1.5935. The knockback threatens to damage the wave structure of the rally from Friday's 14-month low at $1.5792, because the minimum upside requirement target at wave equality target at $1.5962 has not yet been met. Projected support at $1.5874 is a whisker way, and a break below $1.5874 would leave Tuesday's high at $1.5944 as a pending bull failure, triggering additional downside risk to $1.5837. The $1.5792 low would then become vulnerable. Confirmation of the bull failure would be acquired on a break below $1.5837. GBP/USD is at $1.5884.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Francis Bray, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones Chief Technical\f28 \uc2 \f2  Analyst For Europe.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (francis.bray@dowjones.com)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (This article is general financial information, not personalized investment advice, as it does not consider the unique circumstances affecting an individual reader's decision to buy or sell a specific security or \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2  does not warrant the accuracy, completeness or timeliness of the information in this article, and any errors will not be made the basis for any claim against \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 . The author does not invest in the instruments or markets cited in this article.)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 12, 2014 07:45 ET (12:45 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141112eabc001r4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
