\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Rouble calmer; oil heaps more pain on Nigeria\b0\par\par\uc2 By Chris Vellacott   \par \uc2 475 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 November 2014\par 12:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Nov 12 (Reuters) - Falling oil prices heaped more pain on commodity-exporting emerging markets on Wednesday, with Nigeria's naira brushing off recent central back action to extend losses though the rouble held off record lows.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has ended regular, targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the rouble and key figures, including President \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 , have made statements in support of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That has raised the prospect of big, ad hoc dollar sales that would effectively squeeze out short rouble positions.\par \par \uc2 The rouble was quieter against the dollar and euro following steep falls in the previous session and a near-30 percent loss versus the dollar this year.\par \par \uc2 "The market is trying to digest all the new moves that were announced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  which has done the right thing by abolishing the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  corridor," said Murat Toprak, emerging markets strategist at \uc2 HSBC\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Oil exporter Nigeria's naira fell half a percent, a day after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars. Hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have slumped to four-month lows and three-month forwards are pricing the naira at 176 per dollar versus the spot rate of 169.\par \par \uc2 Stronger-than-expected manufacturing data published Tuesday failed to buoy South Africa's rand. The market, like many others, has suffered from investors being tempted away by better prospects offered by a strong dollar as commodity prices damage the outlook for many emerging economies.\par \par \uc2 "In emerging markets... local factors are not really at play, it's more a matter of the dollar going up or down," Toprak said.\par \par \uc2 Ukrainian debt insurance costs hit five-year highs with 5-year credit default swaps rising 43 basis points from Tuesday to 1,392 bps, Markit said.\par \par \uc2 In the Gulf, Saudi stocks rose close to 0.5 percent, lifted by a 10 percent surge in the National Commercial Bank on its first trading day after a $6 billion listing.\par \par \uc2 Central Europe's biggest economy, Poland, saw the zloty weaken 0.3 percent ahead of October inflation data which is likely to make the case for interest rate cuts.\par \par \uc2 Earlier, South Korea's won hit a 14-month low as a sinking \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Japan - its main export market - sparked concerns about where growth will come from.\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/jus35t"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/jus35t}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/weh36s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/weh36s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging Europe performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/jun28s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/jun28s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI frontier index performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s}}}\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see ) (Additional reporting by Sujata Rao, editing by John Stonestreet) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-11-12T12:02:40.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020141112eabc00cyr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
