\par\par \b \uc2 Russia Takes Step In Right Direction, Says BNPP -- Market Talk\b0\par\par\uc2 1,469 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 2014\par 12:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 1151 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ]--The \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilize the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is certainly a step in the right direction, says Piotr Chwiejczak, a strategist at \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2 . He adds it is also significant that President Putin himself has talked specifically about the dollar for the first time. "This shows that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciation it has become a national security issue and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is indeed prepared to do a lot more if necessary," he says. "The situation is still very unstable in Russia and Ukraine and the ruble trend has certainly not been reversed for good, but the worst appears to be over." (josie.cox@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 6:42 EST - Once one of main tenets of Brazil's economy growth, consumption has been lacking for some time and there's no near-term signs that will change, says \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 . "The consumer environment will continue to get tougher, and while some key consumption indicators (i.e. retail sales, unemployment and wages) are still holding up relatively well, the fact is that growth continues to smoothly decelerate and there seems to be limited tools available to reignite growth." As such, the investment bank says that raises earnings risk for Brazilian companies. (rogerio.jelmayer@wsj.com)\par \par \uc2 1139 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ]--Raiffeisen expects \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders to renew attacks on ruble after a short pause, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  "to act according to its words" and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Adds it sees no signs of a households' panic \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying over the past week-end. alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1126 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The drivers for ruble appreciation today were primarily the CBR's announcement that it will limit ruble liquidity, as well as \f28 \uc2 \f2 Vladimir Putin\f28 \uc2 \f2 's verbal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Societe Generale\f28 \uc2 \f2 . "The latter presages likely actions from the authorities to stem further substantial ruble weakness," says strategist Phoenix Kalen. The CBR has moved to a discretionary \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  regime, with limitations on ruble liquidity may help to stabilize the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  over the short term. "However, ruble volatility and weakness may persist until there is more clarity on the CBR's appetite for deploying discretionary \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , while longer term ruble depreciation may continue on deteriorating fundamentals," says the strategist. (chiara.albanese@wsj.com @chiaraalbanese) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1125 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Markets are now pricing a "small probability" of a Norwegian rate cut in December ,and that the policy rate will bottom out at 1.20% during 2015, says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Danske Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2 . But it thinks current market pricing is hard to justify. Chief analyst Arne Lohmann Rasmussen says that given the weakening of the NOK and lower margins between lending rates and the policy rate, "it's doubtful that the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Norges Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  will be as dovish as the market expects, and we see a risk of a reversal of the recent spread performance." \f28 \uc2 \f2 Danske\f28 \uc2 \f2  therefore recommends remaining on the sidelines for Tuesday's Norwegian bond auction, where the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  offers NOK2 billion of the May 2019-dated bond, although it still believes the five-year segment could perform somewhat against the swap, Mr. Rasmussen says. (emese.bartha@wsj.com; @EmeseBartha) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1115 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--There is no imminent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risk to the Russian banking system right now as the share of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -denominated deposits and loans in the banks' balance sheets substantially moderated after 2008, says Sergey Voronenko Associate Director at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Standard & Poor's\f28 \uc2 \f2 , but "if the customers start to withdraw 5% to 10% of deposits a month, we would be worried." Anticipates that a prolonged volatility risk on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market could transfer into a credit risk, as banks will likely face a rising share of impaired loans which would need to be at least restructured. (alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1111 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Hungary's government and banks agreed Sunday on details of converting households' non-forint mortgages into local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . However, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Goldman Sachs\f28 \uc2 \f2  points out that, even after \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  mortgages are eliminated, Hungary will still face large repayments of foreign-\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -denominated debt and lower growth. Thus the government would probably prefer a weaker \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to stimulate exports, it adds. Goldman is still dubious on the forint's prospects even if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  steadies for the rest of this year and early next, as it expects, and it's looking to re-enter a long-term bearish stance, from its current neutral position. (margit.feher@wsj.com @margitfeher) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0000 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] Resistance at 130.73/130.78 on the December BTP future is braced for renewed pressure, which is the last line of defence protecting the quarter of highs between 131.25 and 131.29 that were set during October. Strength during Monday's current session has consigned Friday's low at 130.16 to bear failure status, signalling a return to the last week's 130.73/130.78 highs. Furthermore, Thursday's low at 129.66 is also a confirmed bear failure, indicating the likelihood of a sustained break through 130.78 to open the 131.25/131.29 contract highs. The 130.16 low has protection at 130.30, and only a reversal below 130.16 would concern near-term bulls. The December BTP future is at 130.60.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Francis Bray, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones Chief Technical\f28 \uc2 \f2  Analyst For Europe.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (francis.bray@dowjones.com)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (This article is general financial information, not personalized investment advice, as it does not consider the unique circumstances affecting an individual reader's decision to buy or sell a specific security or \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2  does not warrant the accuracy, completeness or timeliness of the information in this article, and any errors will not be made the basis for any claim against \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 . The author does not invest in the instruments or markets cited in this article.)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1105 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Russian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is unlikely to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market this week as it will limit itself to monitoring the situation, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sberbank CIB\f28 \uc2 \f2  says, adding that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  could materialize at RUB48.60 for dollar. Expects higher than usual exchange rate volatility. Trades at RUB45.18. (alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1044 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] Thailand's military-appointed government will push for the passing of a law to collect taxes on inheritance, according to Sommai Phasee, the finance minister. Under the new law, each immediate heir will be subject to a maximum of 10% tax on inheritance over 50 million baht ($1.5 million). "I'm trying to push for the highest possible tax rate which is still much lower than in Europe and the U.S., where the rate is at 40%," says Sommai. But if the inheritance is passed on before the testator passes away, each heir will only have to pay a 5% tax for the amount in excess of 10 million baht, the finance minister adds. (nopparat.chaichalearmmongkol@dowjones.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1044 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Russia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said Monday it will \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets if it thinks that the ruble's dynamics are leading to expectations of steady falls. It will also \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if it sees increased demand for foreign cash, higher dollarization of deposits and a substantial worsening of financial soundness of banks and companies. (andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1033 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--EUR/HUF trades at 309.44, largely unchanged from the levels seen at the end of last week. The forint is in a wait-and-see mode ahead of Tuesday's October inflation data, says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Commerzbank\f28 \uc2 \f2 , as the reading could deepen rate-cut expectations if it shows prices fell again. This static situation comes despite \f28 \uc2 \f2 Moody's\f28 \uc2 \f2  raising its Hungary credit-rating outlook to stable, from negative, after markets closed on Friday, and after an agreement on Sunday between the Hungarian government and banks that the conversion of households' \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  mortgages into forints may take place at near market rates. (margit.feher@wsj.com @margitfeher) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 10, 2014 06:51 ET (11:51 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141110eaba001s2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
