\par\par \b \uc2 Thai Govt Seeks 'Highest Possible' Inheritance Tax -- Market Talk\b0\par\par\uc2 1,316 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 2014\par 11:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 1044 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ] Thailand's military-appointed government will push for the passing of a law to collect taxes on inheritance, according to Sommai Phasee, the finance minister. Under the new law, each immediate heir will be subject to a maximum of 10% tax on inheritance over 50 million baht ($1.5 million). "I'm trying to push for the highest possible tax rate which is still much lower than in Europe and the U.S., where the rate is at 40%," says Sommai. But if the inheritance is passed on before the testator passes away, each heir will only have to pay a 5% tax for the amount in excess of 10 million baht, the finance minister adds. (nopparat.chaichalearmmongkol@dowjones.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \f28 \par \par \uc2 1044 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ]--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Monday it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if it thinks that the ruble's dynamics are leading to expectations of steady falls. It will also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it sees increased demand for foreign cash, higher dollarization of deposits and a substantial worsening of financial soundness of banks and companies. (andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1033 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--EUR/HUF trades at 309.44, largely unchanged from the levels seen at the end of last week. The forint is in a wait-and-see mode ahead of Tuesday's October inflation data, says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Commerzbank\f28 \uc2 \f2 , as the reading could deepen rate-cut expectations if it shows prices fell again. This static situation comes despite \f28 \uc2 \f2 Moody's\f28 \uc2 \f2  raising its Hungary credit-rating outlook to stable, from negative, after markets closed on Friday, and after an agreement on Sunday between the Hungarian government and banks that the conversion of households' \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  mortgages into forints may take place at near market rates. (margit.feher@wsj.com @margitfeher) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1032 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] Amtek Global Technologies, a unit of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Amtek Auto\f28 \uc2 \f2  (520077.BY), said Monday that \f28 \uc2 \f2 KKR\f28 \uc2 \f2  (\f28 \uc2 \f2 KKR\f28 \uc2 \f2 ) will provide the company with 235 million euros ($292.6 million) of long-term financing to replace a bridge loan and consolidate all of the company's existing debt. Amtek, with turnover of over $2.7 billion, provides engineered components for passenger cars, commercial vehicles and two and three-wheelers. Unlike its peers that invest in direct equity, \f28 \uc2 \f2 KKR\f28 \uc2 \f2  has been lending money to help Indian firms deleverage. (kenan.machado@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1021 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--The decision of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Russia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to let the ruble float freely, by eliminating the ruble trading corridor and regular \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , would further reduce systemic reserve depletion and should support Russian credit rating, says Dmitri Petrov from Nomura. Notes the change is marginal as the unlimited \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were already dropped last week. (alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1017 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] \f28 \uc2 \f2 Accenture PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (ACN) has received one of the first contracts in a nationwide program designed to spread technology across India. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Accenture\f28 \uc2 \f2 's contract is tiny, just $70,000 from the state government of Arunachal Pradesh, but it is part of a $18.38 billion program. According to the terms of the deal, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Accenture\f28 \uc2 \f2  will help citizens in the eastern Indian state of Arunachal Pradesh access government services ranging from safety and health alerts, to employment services and pension benefits using cell phones. It will also build mobile apps for government services, which will be available on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Apple Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's iStore, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Google Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Play and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Microsoft Corp\f28 \uc2 \f2 .'s Windows Phone store. (krishna.jai@wsj.com; \f28 \uc2 \f2 Twitter\f28 \uc2 \f2 : @jaikrishna) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1014 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Italy's gross debt issuance--treasury bills and the various types of government bonds together--is expected to decline only slightly to EUR447 billion in 2015, from EUR459 billion this year, as the total amount of redemptions barely changes, totaling EUR387 billion next year versus EUR390 billion this year, says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Intesa Sanpaolo\f28 \uc2 \f2 's fixed income strategist \f28 \uc2 \f2 Chiara Manenti\f28 \uc2 \f2 . The most closely watched item is BTPs - conventional government bonds- of which Ms. Manenti expects EUR171 billion to be issued next year versus EUR173 billion this year due BTP redemptions rising to EUR141 billion from EUR90 billion this year. This, however, implies a massive fall in net BTP issuance to EUR30 billion from EUR84 billion, she adds. (emese.bartha@wsj; @EmeseBartha) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1008 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--EUR/CHF breached support at 1.2025 Monday and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Barclays\f28 \uc2 \f2  says this signals scope for a test of the 1.20 floor, which has been in place since September 2011. The bank remains cautiously bearish, but is on watch for signs of a base. EUR/CHF now 1.2027. gary.stride@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1007 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--Hungary's consumer prices are expected to have dropped again in October, but less than in September, a poll by The Wall Street Journal of the views from nine commercial bank economists shows. The median poll shows headline inflation could be -0.3% on the year in October versus -0.5% in September, given a state cut of household electricity prices and as low fuel prices aren't fully offset by increasing food prices. \f28 \uc2 \f2 CPI\f28 \uc2 \f2  data will be published at 0800 GMT Tuesday. (veronika.gulyas@wsj.com; @VeronikaGulyas1) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1005 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--We may be seeing some relief for the ruble today, but the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is certainly not out of the woods, says Piotr Matys, emerging market strategist at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Rabobank\f28 \uc2 \f2  in London. Speaking after the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Russian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reiterated that it stands ready to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at any time, sending the ruble up over 2% against the dollar, Mr. Matys says his view is that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will still be necessary to create financial stability. "My base case is also that we will have to see another aggressive interest rate hike, perhaps of as much as 200 basis points. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on its own might not be enough," he adds. (josie.cox@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1001 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ]--U.S. Treasuries are a fraction higher Monday in light turnover ahead of Tuesday's Veterans Day holiday in the U.S. - bond market closed/stock market open. The December contract is 4/32 higher at 126-250 and the 10-year yields 2.295%. The economic calendar is very light this week with only the announcement of the Treasury Budget Thursday and retail sales Friday of any note. The markets will likely take more interest on the refunding auctions this week with USD26 bn 3-years, USD24 bn 10-years and USD16 bn 30-years all on offer this week. (nick.cawley@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par markettalk@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1000 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] Health care providers in India are expected to spend $1.1 billion on technology products and services in 2014, an increase of 5% over 2013, according to Gartner. Consulting, implementation, IT outsourcing and business process outsourcing, will be the largest overall spending category throughout the forecast period at about $300 million in 2014, up from $280 million in 2013. Within this, the consulting segment is expected to grow at 10%, says Gartner. India's new government will closely examine ways to deliver cost-effective healthcare across the country, says Gartner. (kenan.machado@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 10, 2014 05:44 ET (10:44 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141110eaba001fq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw77\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1155\pichgoal600
