\par\par \b \uc2 *Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  Chief Says Ready To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene FX \highlight\uc2  Market At Any Time\b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 2014\par 09:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 10 Nov 2014 03:50 ET *Bank Of Russia Chief Says Will Temporarily Limit Ruble Liquidity Injections\par \par \uc2 10 Nov 2014 03:50 ET *Bank Of Russia Chief: Liquidity Limits To Prevent Speculation Against Ruble\par \par \uc2 10 Nov 2014 03:59 ET *Bank Of Russia: Eliminates Ruble Trading Corridor From Nov 10\par \par \uc2 10 Nov 2014 04:31 ET  Bank Of Russia Lets Ruble Float Freely\par \par \uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--The Bank of Russia said Monday it let the ruble float freely by eliminating the ruble trading corridor and regular \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , retaining a right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , if needed, for financial stability.\par \par \uc2 The ruble showed muted reaction, easing to 45.72 versus the dollar as of 0903 GMT from around 45.64 seen before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's statement.\par \par \uc2 "As a result of the decision the ruble exchange rate will be determined by market factors, which should promote efficiency of the monetary policy of the Bank of Russia and ensure price stability," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been initially aiming at letting the ruble float freely in 2015 but forced the process and scaled down \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week after failing to stop the ruble from falling by spending nearly $30 billion in October\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's chairwoman, \uc2 Elvira Nabiullina\uc2 , said Monday that from now on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at any time and at any volume needed to blow away speculative demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Ms. Nabiullina also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will limit provision of ruble liquidity, which was partly used for buying hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -0- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 10, 2014 04:31 ET (09:31 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141110eaba0012f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
