the decision it made on Wednesday to limit its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said "the measures taken and the recent exchange rate decline, further ruble weakening is not needed for the balance of payment equilibrium."\par \par \uc2 Write to Alexander Kolyandr at alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 November 07, 2014 09:35 ET (14:35 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141107eab7002sd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
